{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217060","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1621706001:0":{"text":"It stopped moving. The source should be nearby.","source_cn":"风向标停下来了，带有强烈魔法波动的物品应该就在附近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC22C64D53613EBF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621706002:0":{"text":"Hmm... there are so many things in this shop. Which one is the curio?","source_cn":"唔……这家商店展览着好多东西，会是哪个呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B32D9419984F77F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1621706003:0":{"text":"Seline brings the weathervane close to the goods, examining them one by one.","source_cn":"赛琳举着魔法风向标靠近一众商品，仔细地逐个辨别","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B762DD221C03A5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1621706004:0":{"text":"Finally, she stops before an antique mirror...","source_cn":"最终，她停在了一面古董镜前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57A98DFA4A699DEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621706005:1":{"text":"I think this is it!","source_cn":"经过严谨的辨别和判断，我认为……这面古董镜，是一件神奇物品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F17C45310DFDCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::2":{"text":"Antique Mirror","source_cn":"古董镜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44AD45114CC05974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621706006:0":{"text":"This mirror doesn't seem special to me...","source_cn":"我怎么感觉这只是一面普通的旧镜子……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x58F6748B62C2B477","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This mirror doesn't seem special to me...","female":"This mirror doesn't seem special to me...","variant_male_record_index":"205810","variant_female_record_index":"205811","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621706007:0":{"text":"I can see lots of scratches on it. How do we know if it's a genuine antique or just artificially aged?","source_cn":"上面确实有挺多划痕的。这是真的古董，还是故意做旧的啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36F14E2450578972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621706008:1":{"text":"I'm not sure either. Let me take a closer look...","source_cn":"不确定，得再离近点看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2532E7AEC58AF830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621706009:0":{"text":"Nice pick! That's my prized possession!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，各位客人的眼光可真不错啊！","statu